<p>You're in!</p>
<p>Your Sessy account has been approved. Here's how to start watching your SES activity:</p>
<ol>
  <li><%= link_to "Sign in", new_session_url %> with this email address — we'll send you a one-time code.</li>
  <li>Create a source for each SES configuration set you want to track. Each source gets its own webhook URL.</li>
  <li>Point your configuration set's event destination (SNS) at that webhook URL — deliveries, bounces, complaints, opens, and clicks show up moments later.</li>
</ol>
<p style="color: #71717a; font-size: 14px;">Stuck or have questions? Just reply to this email.</p>
